  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Explore outdoor comfort with Rothco's Digital Camo BDU Shirts. Crafted from tough Poly/Cotton Twill, these shirts provide durability without compromising on comfort. The BDU Shirt Jacket is designed for maximum utility, featuring 4 large button-down bellowed pockets and a front button pocket with a secure flap closure. Adjustable button tab cuff sleeves ensure a customizable fit for every wearer. Rothco's commitment to durability is evident in the reinforced elbows and double-stitched seams of the BDU Fatigue Shirt.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "13314",
  "description": "<p>Explore outdoor comfort with Rothco's Digital Camo BDU Shirts. Crafted from tough Poly/Cotton Twill, these shirts provide durability without compromising on comfort. The BDU Shirt Jacket is designed for maximum utility, featuring 4 large button-down bellowed pockets and a front button pocket with a secure flap closure. Adjustable button tab cuff sleeves ensure a customizable fit for every wearer. Rothco's commitment to durability is evident in the reinforced elbows and double-stitched seams of the BDU Fatigue Shirt, making it resilient for various outdoor activities. The matching Camo BDU pants and uniform accessories complete your tactical ensemble seamlessly. As your go-to source for tactical uniforms, Rothco offers an extensive selection of BDU Fatigue Shirts and BDU Pants. Step into the outdoors with confidence, knowing that Rothco provides the quality and variety you need for your outdoor pursuits.</p>",
